  "details": "I'm getting some very rare occasions where a user will upload an update to an existing avatar and it won't apply the changes for long periods of time. One user experienced the issue over about 3 hours starting 3/6/2022 at 11AM PST, and another one experienced it over I think 2-3 days about 36 hours after the release of OSC.\nGenerating a new blueprint solves the issue.\nI'm guessing it's all queued so a delay on heavy load times is what I'm expecting, but their issue spanned a long period of time, making me think something happened on the back end.",
